{"id": "EUVD-2026-103515", "enisaUuid": "6a598b36-b60e-3d9c-857f-da06040349e9", "description": "Schroedinger libschroedinger through 1.0.11 contains an out-of-bounds read vulnerability that allows attackers to read past a static quantiser table by supplying unvalidated wavelet filter index or transform depth values. Attackers can deliver a crafted low-delay Dirac stream with a wavelet filter index of 7 or more or transform depth of 5 or 6 to crash decoding applications.", "datePublished": "2026-10-18T12:19:44", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-19T20:28:25", "baseScore": 6.8, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:L/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:P/VC:N/VI:N/VA:H/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://hackmd.io/@haindpwn/schroedinger-lowdelay-quant-matrix-oob", "https://github.com/Distrotech/schroedinger/blob/schroedinger-1.0.11/schroedinger/schroparams.c#L463", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/schroedinger-libschroedinger-through-1.0.11-out-of-bounds-read-via-schro-params-set-default-quant-matrix"], "aliases": ["GHSA-6hwf-vcvv-9jh9", "CVE-2026-112053"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.12, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "fc6baa8a-e374-33d3-89b7-c09daece42a8", "product": {"name": "schroedinger", "vendor": {"name": "Schroedinger"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22641.0.11"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "688b55a5-44f5-3ac6-901d-070d359e1ca8", "vendor": {"name": "Schroedinger"}}], "isExploited": false}